---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="page prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hello, I'm {SITE.author}.</p>
    <p>
      I work on LLMs and agent training: how data, feedback, evaluation, and
      iteration shape more capable AI agents.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is where I document experiments, lessons from building and
      evaluating agents, and ideas that remain useful after the moment has
      passed. Each post is a place to think in public, revise, and keep
      learning.
    </p>
    <p>You can find my projects on <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
